<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab militants ambushed a team on the Arabia-Lafey road in northeastern Kenya, killing two National Police Reservists and five civilian construction workers, and also targeted a security escort vehicle nearby. Somali Danab commandos have begun security operations in Middle Shabelle to dismantle Al-Shabaab extortion networks. US forces conducted overnight airstrikes against ISIS positions in Puntland, Somalia. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQdk1XU216eUFxRzdTN0dUMl9tejJwcEhMMUNaZ0NEUFkybGN4cWQ2blY4VjREakhMVnJhY3hCdUZzdEN3TDV1cENrTmY0Z25TM1NTVHY0Z0VoU2dBV0ZNaGxVUTlsRFRwaTVXM3BFSmhuNnA2LTY0UUV3QVE3V0NOSXZ1TmdXcGYwSkxTSjVaeHY1S21zVW5WU19MOFE5Vmg5dkdUcFZaUXA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tribune Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxNN1VpOXM4UGNzazlJLWY5TnIxVmgtLXd6NVlVb3JxREJoRkpoaFlXcUxWaVRRamM0ZVlhX0JmOVJXcnpWbGtXQ0dFcVd5Q1l2LTVMTzJESFhuR2ZkSkZKWlpnRTVqWTNGX05hWWN4Y2szVUlRWkF4cWtBNDk1aU9hTFhETVR1VmF1cllSSEhFTWw0elpHRkoxLTE5Ymx0OGVpbnQ3dDBxZ1hKaG42MTEwVkJXXzFqLVZFSWtndm9vaDZOUXBuOFFGZjJoQVM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE9qVHAyQWhrckEyX1ZEbWRCd1plSUc2aFFuTmZnOS01RnNGSlpTT2hlLVRab3ZzVVRYWWhTN21rSXN2WjVSVWx2Z2cyUFlTcHFYZHROX2xyOS1oc180WmxqRV9VSjI5eUlGZzhXeDVXUEVrdU5JN21r?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxQcy1VZFB1TUp1SmZFQk5qUU9iQU8yVWg1YU5XN0VtaTUzRFRsdUJDV0o3Q19MSmxocUVQTjV3QWEtd3hpSmFQSlF1SEdoNnBUX1F2Ti1LY3NKLWk5SkZIOTVua3owRkZnTjRZRzRMNUpKS01ULUtBMU96UkdVNXQtQVk2UlNEOTd5bmFMbms4aWU3M3lkU3F2ZWJUUkc5czkyaDBicHQwbmZLMW9i?oc=5&quot;&gt;T